WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.535
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.970
We hope you're all doing well
tonight.

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.038
And now, if you don't mind,
we are gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.038 --> 00:00:09.776
In his new book, ex-Defense
Secretary Mark Esper writes that

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:12.846
despite his hatred of press
leaks, former president Trump

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:15.081
was "the biggest leaker of all."

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:17.917
Said Trump, "Well, that's
the last time I show him

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:20.386
the Area 51 aliens.
Oh, damn it!

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:22.588
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:25.691
President Biden criticized
Republicans at a fundraiser

00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:28.294
last night for their recent
attacks on Disney and said,

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:31.163
"They're going to storm
Cinderella's castle

00:00:31.163 --> 00:00:32.298
before this is over."

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:33.733
Oh, buddy, I hate to tell you,

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:37.203
if they're storming anything,
it's the Hall of Presidents.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.571
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:41.241
Also, that's me, right?

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:49.182
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:52.651
I mean, imagine.

00:00:52.651 --> 00:00:56.656
That's how I found out
I was a president.

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:59.725
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.725 --> 00:01:01.727
President Biden told
a small gathering

00:01:01.727 --> 00:01:04.530
at a Democratic fundraiser last
night that it's gonna be hard

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.699
to maintain the majority
in both houses of Congress,

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:09.435
especially since they don't have
it in the first place.

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:10.870
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.807
Arizona Senator Kyrsten Sinema
appeared on the Senate floor

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:16.242
yesterday wearing
a pink tie-dyed shirt

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:17.643
that said, "no thanks."

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:20.847
I don't know what that means
except that Arizona elected

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:23.116
a senator who only shops
at airports.

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:24.817
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:29.222
Even weirder, Bernie Sanders was
wearing this.

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:32.891
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.891 --> 00:01:34.226
[ as Sanders ] I need it.

00:01:34.226 --> 00:01:35.795
I don't know what to tell you,
I need it.

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:37.663
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.663 --> 00:01:41.701
I'm not gonna apologize.
Mama needs wine.

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:43.836
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.836 --> 00:01:46.638
[ Normal voice ]
President Biden today called
Ferdinand Marcos Jr.

00:01:46.638 --> 00:01:47.807
to congratulate him
on winning

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:49.442
the Philippine presidential
election.

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:52.078
Said Biden, "Remember, winning
is the easy part.

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:53.846
The hard part is convincing

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:55.915
everybody that
you actually won."

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:57.816
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.816 --> 00:02:00.386
While speaking yesterday to
thousands of union

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:02.521
electrical workers,
President Biden referred to

00:02:02.521 --> 00:02:05.258
former president Trump as
"the great MAGA king."

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:08.628
Okay, can we please not give him
any more ideas?

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.329
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.329 --> 00:02:13.232
North Korea reported its first
coronavirus outbreak today

00:02:13.232 --> 00:02:15.935
and ordered all cities
and counties to enter

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:19.072
a lockdown or, as they call it,
business as usual.

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:21.807
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.807 --> 00:02:24.777
New York Mayor Eric Adams said
on Tuesday that

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:27.247
his official residence,
Gracie Mansion, is haunted

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:29.549
and added, "I don't care what
anyone says.

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:31.217
There are ghosts in there."

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:34.654
Mm. I don't think that's
who's booing you.

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:36.489
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:40.592
According to a new study,
the top three baby names

00:02:40.592 --> 00:02:42.861
that are set to make a comeback
this year are

00:02:42.861 --> 00:02:44.930
Joan, Mary, and Margaret,

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:48.234
which is also a full curse
in a Catholic household.

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:50.903
[ Irish accent ]
"Oh, Joan, Mary, and Margaret!"

00:02:50.903 --> 00:02:54.707
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:57.710
[ Normal voice ] And fi--
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.045
[ Irish accent ]
"I stubbed me toe!"

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:04.583
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:07.186
[ Normal voice ] I've got a
little bit of criticism recently

00:03:07.186 --> 00:03:09.222
about my really good
Irish accent.

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:11.157
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.157 --> 00:03:14.159
And finally, the New York state
lottery announced yesterday

00:03:14.159 --> 00:03:16.796
that the results of Tuesday's
drawing were published

00:03:16.796 --> 00:03:18.964
with the wrong Mega Ball number.

00:03:18.964 --> 00:03:22.568
And things are pretty awkward at
the house that thought they won.

00:03:22.568 --> 00:03:25.037
"Honey, I was joking about
the divorce.

00:03:25.037 --> 00:03:26.606
That was --"
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.606 --> 00:03:29.708
"Ha, ha, it's me.
That's when I'm funny."

00:03:29.708 --> 00:03:32.412
[ Laughter ]
That was a monologue, everybody.

